ds come with big risks! Expand your bank\u2019s influence by printing counterfeit money and laundering it without getting caught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393240/extras/ezgif-6-5fa73c64cd.gif?t=1744205522\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ID VERIFICATION &amp; FRAUD DETECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every client is trustworthy! Conduct identity checks, detect fake documents, and safeguard your bank\u2019s reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393240/extras/ezgif-1-b1394bee85__1_.gif?t=1744205522\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LIVE THE HIGH LIFE \u2013 SPEND, INVEST, AND RISE TO THE TOP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banking is just the beginning! Use your wealth to enjoy a luxurious lifestyle, invest in profitable ventures, and establish your status. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMER SATISFACTION &amp; BANK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A successful bank is built on trust! Offer top-tier financial services, negotiate deals, and maintain a loyal client base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CASH HANDLING &amp; TELLER OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage large amounts of cash and ensure seamless banking transactions. Every bill counts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features in the Game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Counterfeit Money Printing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vault Rental</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currency Exchange Operations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Identity Verification</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Money Counting Mechanism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Security System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Credit Card System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicle-Based Money Transfers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loan System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruitment</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADD TO WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no limit to how much money you can make! Take control of the financial world, build your banking empire, and rise to the top. Don\u2019t miss out on this immersive banking experience \u2013 <strong>add Banker Simulator to your Steam Wishlist now</strong> and be among the first to play!</p>","developers":["Soi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393240/header.jpg?t=1744205522","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098564,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098564/movie480.mp4?t=1740233658","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098564/movie_max.mp4?t=1740233658"},"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098564/88975957f250800c18ac990dfce2574617f49319/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740233658","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098564/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740233658","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098564/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740233658"}}],"name":"Banker Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 / AMD FX 4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</s